msgid "Appendices"
msgstr "附录"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/index.md:8
msgid ""
"The five lettered appendices collect material that benefits from being "
"separate from the narrative but that readers return to frequently: a role-"
"grouped FAQ, a glossary, a reading list, the HarnessCard template, and a "
"consolidated ``CLAUDE.md`` sample. The sixth body of appendix-style "
"material — a 60-minute internal-talk script distilled from the whole book "
"— has been promoted to **Part 0 · Presentation** at the front of the "
"book, because it is meant to be *given* rather than *consulted*."
msgstr ""
"这五份带字母的附录汇集了那些\"从叙事中分出来更合适、却又会被读者频繁回访\"的材料："
"一份按角色分组的 FAQ、一份术语表、一份阅读单、HarnessCard 模板，以及一份合并起来"
"的 ``CLAUDE.md`` 样板。第六份曾经以附录形态存在的材料 —— 一份从全书凝练出来的 "
"60 分钟内部分享讲稿 —— 已被提前到全书最前面的 **Part 0 · Presentation**，"
"因为它是用来 *讲* 的，而不是用来 *查阅* 的。"
